\par\par \b \uc2 CORRECT: Asia Central Banks  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Curb  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Gains As Dollar Slides\b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juli 2011\par 11:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 ("Asia Central Banks \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Curb \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gains As Dollar Slides," at 0839 GMT, misstated the level at which the Bank of Korea was suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the fourth paragraph. The correct version follows:)\par \par \uc2 -- Central banks in \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Thailand and the Philippines \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow gains in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 -- U.S. debt ceiling impasse propels Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  upward\par \par \uc2 -- Philippines' Purisima says U.S. debt imbroglio speeds the dollar's decline\par \par \uc2 By Martin Vaughan\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Several Asian central banks were seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Tuesday, as the U.S. political stalemate on increasing the government borrowing cap caused the dollar to tumble against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Philippines Secretary of Finance Cesar Purisima said U.S. failure to reach a debt deal is causing a "loss of confidence" in the dollar and could "accelerate the search for an alternate reserve \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 Purisima said U.S. leaders are "missing the point" and are endangering the dollar's preeminent status, used as the default \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the globe in trade and finance.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Korea was suspected of buying around $300 million in an attempt to slow the won's rise, said traders in Seoul. The bank may have been trying to defend the psychological level of KRW1,050 to the dollar, the traders said.\par \par \uc2 The Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated to have bought as much as $200 million at various levels as the peso climbed to its highest mark in three years. The dollar hit a low of PHP42.22.\par \par \uc2 Bangkok dealers said the \uc2 Bank of Thailand\uc2  also engaged in mild dollar buying to curb the baht's rise, as the greenback slipped to THB29.68, its lowest since November 2010.\par \par \uc2 "The idea that we're seeing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a consistent theme across Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  right now," said Robert Rennie, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Westpac Institutional Bank.\par \par \uc2 After notching substantial gains in the first four months of the year, the riskier \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging Asia had been hemmed in recently by fears surrounding sovereign debt in the euro-zone periphery. Those fears were to some extent calmed by the announcement last week of a second bailout for Greece, setting the stage for Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen.\par \par \uc2 Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were further boosted Tuesday as the dollar sank on comments from President Barack Obama and House Speaker John Boehner which revealed that any deal to cut spending and raise the U.S. debt ceiling remains far off. U.S. officials have said they have only until Aug. 2 to raise borrowing limits or risk missing debt servicing payments.\par \par \uc2 -By Martin Vaughan; +65 6415 4033; martin.vaughan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -Alex Frangos in Hong Kong, Jieun Shin in Seoul, Phisanu Phromchanya in Bangkok and Rhea Sandique-Carlos in Manila contributed to this article [ 26-07-11 0930GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110726e77q000u7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
