\par\par \b \uc2 S Korea Won Up Late, BOK Likely  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  To Curb Won Strength\b0\par\par\uc2 486 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Februar 2011\par 09:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                      Close     Change \par  USD/KRW            1,104.70  -2.80 \par  JPY/KRW            13.4212   -0.0438 \par  3-Year Treasurys   4.06%     -4 bps \par  5-Year Treasurys   4.51%     unchanged \par  10-Year Treasurys  4.81%     +1 bp \par  20-Year Treasurys  4.91%     unchanged \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SEOUL (Dow Jones)--The South Korean won was higher against the dollar late Tuesday, tracking regional peers, but gains were likely capped by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  toward the close of the domestic session.\f28 \par \par \uc2 The dollar hit a intraday low of KRW1,102.50--its lowest since KRW1,097 on Sept. 12, 2008--as investors piled into risk-sensitive \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the region, before trimming losses on corporate buying and suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Korea is suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth the won's rise late in the local session, likely buying the dollar near KRW1,104, according to three Seoul-based traders. Two of those traders estimated the buying at between $300 million and $500 million.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities were last suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on Jan. 13, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely bought dollars near KRW1,110-KRW1,111.\par \par \uc2 "A view that the authorities won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been dominant recently," given the government's repeated pledge to curb inflation pressures, a foreign bank trader said.\par \par \uc2 However, traders now expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue its smoothing \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb sharp gains in the won, despite implied criticism in the U.S. Treasury's latest \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report of \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-supportive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The psychologically important KRW1,100 level is likely to hold ahead of the Bank of Korea's rate review Friday, traders say, citing the high chance of further \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  around that level.\par \par \uc2 A significant decrease in foreign purchases of local stocks recently and persistent dollar demand from corporates will also slow the won's gains, said Samsung Futures analyst Jeon Seung-ji.\par \par \uc2 Treasury bonds were mixed, with some tenors and bond futures staging a mild rebound after their sharp losses Monday.\par \par \uc2 The yield on the one-year treasury bonds fell two basis points to 3.40%, while March bond futures gained 18 ticks, recouping some of its 34-tick fall during the previous session.\par \par \uc2 Traders, however, remain skeptical over whether bonds will be able hold on to gains.\par \par \uc2 "There aren't many investors buying bonds for their long-term investments," given the BOK's monetary tightening cycle," said a bond manager with an asset management firm.\par \par \uc2 Economists and analysts were evenly divided over whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise its policy rate for a second straight month in February, with eight out of 16 economists and fixed-income analysts surveyed by Dow Jones Newswires forecasting a 25 basis-point hike.\par \par \uc2 -By Min-Jeong Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; 822-3700-1908; min-jeong.lee@dowjones.com [ 08-02-11 0820GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1063 1858   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110208e728000qt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
