\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Asia rises on stock gains, China stimulus hopes\b0\par\par\uc2 By Kevin Yao  \par \uc2 689 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 09:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, March 4 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose on Wednesday as investors snapped up stocks in the hope that China will step up efforts to spur its economy, with suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  boosting \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's won and the Singapore dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Philippine peso <PHP=> rose a third of a percent to 48.65 per dollar as a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said falling inflation had created room for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cut interest rates, a day before the interest rate review.\par \par \uc2 Deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Diwa Guinigundo also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would avoid \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  given the peso's relative stability. [ID:nSP405920]\par \par \uc2 The peso is down 2.4 percent against the dollar so far this year -- the second best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the Chinese yuan <CNY=CFXS> in those that are tracked daily by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Thai baht <THB=TH> gained almost 0.4 percent to 36 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The volatile South Korean won <KRW=> rose as much as 1 percent to 1,535.2 per dollar as dealers suspected the authorities were selling dollars to support the ailing unit.\par \par \uc2 The won, the worst performing Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is still down 19 percent against the dollar this year.\par \par \uc2 A senior Chinese planning official said on Wednesday the government will increase spending in areas such as infrastructure and manufacturing on top of the 4 trillion yuan ($585 billion) stimulus package unveiled in November. [ID:nL4384]\par \par \uc2 The comment, along with signs of a recovery in China's economy highlighted by a big improvement in the purchasing managers' index, helped boost Asian stocks.\par \par \uc2 The MSCI index of Asia-Pacific shares outside Japan <.MIAPJ0000PUS> rising 1.5 percent as of 0747 GMT.\par \par \uc2 "The bounce in equities probably is the most obvious cue while the broad dollar index has stabilised somewhat, with the additional boost coming from in China of course," said Emmanuel Ng, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 OCBC Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But he cautioned that the near-term outlook for most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained grim due to the worsening global downturn.\par \par \uc2 The Chinese yuan <CNY=CFXS> hovered near 6.84 per dollar, but one-year dollar/yuan non-deliverable forwards <CNYNDFOR=> eased to 6.9553, which implied a fall of 1.6 percent from the spot.\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, the Singapore dollar <SGD=> edged up to 1.5510 to the U.S. dollar as traders cited official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to limit the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's losses.\par \par \uc2 "There was a lot of U.S. dollar buying this morning by U.S. houses and funds," said a Singapore-based trader, adding the unit is supported by U.S. dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A second trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may reflect official concerns about excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness as Singapore dollar is believed to be near the lower end of its undisclosed trading band. \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par